Based on an exhaustive synthesis of elite sports science physiological modeling, wearable device validations, and the biopsychosocial dictates of pain and allostatic load science, the application must distribute 100% of the scoring weight across distinct physiological modules. The following percentage distribution is strictly recommended as the architectural foundation for calculating the global Readiness Score.

